            </h2>
        </div>
        <div class="card-body-modern">
            <div class="alert-modern alert-danger-modern mb-4">
                <div style="display: flex; align-items: start; gap: var(--spacing-md);">
                    <i class="bi bi-exclamation-triangle-fill" style="font-size: 1.5rem; flex-shrink: 0;"></i>
                    <div>
                        <strong>Attention : Cette action est irrÃ©versible</strong>
                        <p style="margin: var(--spacing-sm) 0 0 0;">Toutes vos donnÃ©es seront supprimÃ©es dÃ©finitivement :</p>
                        <ul style="margin: var(--spacing-sm) 0 0 var(--spacing-lg); padding-left: 0;">
